Subject: [PATCH 29/37] A teach answer that repeats the last one is sent back
 once, behind SEQUENCE_TEACH_REPEAT_GUARD=1

Product-mode run 2: a prompt line did not stop MiniCPM5 resending the same answer to three
different questions (similarity 0.79 and 1.0). The grader now compares the draft with the last
assistant answer in the history (5-gram Jaccard >= 0.6), bounces it once for a new answer to the
new question, and never keeps it as the richer draft. 2 full-turn tests; bench arm 'guard'.
